### status: illustrative-only
### llmOperational: false
### protectedContract: false
### referenceOnly: true
### public: false
### authRequired: true
### sessionAuthRequired: true
### tenantScopedHeadersRequired: false
### destructive: true
### requiresTenantHeaders: false
### runtimeRecordConfirmed: false
### selectorConfirmed: true
### publishedBackendConfirmed: false
### knownPublishedFailure: false
### accessMode: authenticated-session
### selectionGuidance: source-derived-payroll-g4-contract
### note: Source-derived G4 candidate, not admitted or confirmed on the published host. Pending event only. If-Match is the captured event ETag. Keep origin 42 token from the event snapshot and capture destination 43 by official payroll GET; same-parent edit needs only one entry. Missing/duplicate/extra/stale tokens fail closed; no automatic refresh/retry.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8088
@sessionCookie = replace-with-session-cookie-value
@folhaId = 42
@eventoId = 21
@xsrfToken = replace-with-XSRF-TOKEN-cookie-value

PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/human-resources/eventos-folha/{{eventoId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{sessionCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrfToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
If-Match: "replace-with-exact-resource-ETag-from-the-same-GET-snapshot"

< ../../payloads/resources/payroll_g4_event_move.json
